      "description": {
        "fun": "Darmanitan's punches can obliterate a dump truck, powered by an inner fire that burns at 1,400 °C. When badly hurt, it hardens into a stone-like statue and meditates, sharpening its mind to fight on, and one in this Zen Mode was found asleep in the Relic Castle after 2,500 years. Its designer saw Daruma dolls burned at a ceremony that happened to look like gorillas, hence its look.",
        "guide": "Darmanitan is the evolved form of Darumaka, a powerful Fire-type Pokémon whose strength rises with the temperature of its inner fire. When weakened it can enter Zen Mode, becoming a Fire- and Psychic-type statue. In Galar it has an Ice-type regional form with its own Zen Mode.",
